{"audio": "2corinthians-02.opus", "duration_ms": 123362, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3881, "text": "2 Corinthians, Chapter Two."}, {"start_ms": 5201, "end_ms": 8702, "text": "So I made up my mind not to make another painful visit to you."}, {"start_ms": 9202, "end_ms": 13102, "text": "For if I grieve you, who is left to cheer me but those whom I have grieved?"}, {"start_ms": 13722, "end_ms": 19183, "text": "I wrote as I did so that on my arrival I would not be grieved by those who ought to make me rejoice."}, {"start_ms": 19684, "end_ms": 22904, "text": "I had confidence in all of you, that you would share my joy."}, {"start_ms": 23864, "end_ms": 31346, "text": "For through many tears I wrote you out of great distress and anguish of heart, not to grieve you but to let you know how much I love you."}, {"start_ms": 32286, "end_ms": 39047, "text": "Now if anyone has caused grief, he has not grieved me but all of you—to some degree, not to overstate it."}, {"start_ms": 39747, "end_ms": 43248, "text": "The punishment imposed on him by the majority is sufficient for him."}, {"start_ms": 43768, "end_ms": 49409, "text": "So instead, you ought to forgive and comfort him, so that he will not be overwhelmed by excessive sorrow."}, {"start_ms": 50429, "end_ms": 53209, "text": "Therefore I urge you to reaffirm your love for him."}, {"start_ms": 54250, "end_ms": 59451, "text": "My purpose in writing you was to see if you would stand the test and be obedient in everything."}, {"start_ms": 60131, "end_ms": 62531, "text": "If you forgive anyone, I also forgive him."}, {"start_ms": 63131, "end_ms": 70032, "text": "And if I have forgiven anything, I have forgiven it in the presence of Christ for your sake, in order that Satan should not outwit us."}, {"start_ms": 70433, "end_ms": 72453, "text": "For we are not unaware of his schemes."}, {"start_ms": 73413, "end_ms": 83115, "text": "Now when I went to Troas to preach the gospel of Christ and a door stood open for me in the Lord, I had no peace in my spirit, because I did not find my brother Titus there."}, {"start_ms": 83755, "end_ms": 86495, "text": "So I said goodbye to them and went on to Macedonia."}, {"start_ms": 87336, "end_ms": 95457, "text": "But thanks be to God, who always leads us triumphantly as captives in Christ and through us spreads everywhere the fragrance of the knowledge of Him."}, {"start_ms": 96097, "end_ms": 101878, "text": "For we are to God the sweet aroma of Christ among those who are being saved and those who are perishing."}, {"start_ms": 102578, "end_ms": 107899, "text": "To the one we are an odor that brings death, to the other a fragrance that brings life."}, {"start_ms": 108379, "end_ms": 110340, "text": "And who is qualified for such a task?"}, {"start_ms": 110960, "end_ms": 115141, "text": "For we are not like so many others, who peddle the word of God for profit."}, {"start_ms": 115801, "end_ms": 121922, "text": "On the contrary, in Christ we speak before God with sincerity, as men sent from God."}], "words": [{"t": "2", "s": 0, "e": 2300, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 2300, "e": 3181, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 3341, "e": 3661, "si": 0}, {"t": "Two.", "s": 3741, "e": 3881, "si": 0}, {"t": "So", "s": 5201, "e": 5281, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 5461, "e": 5481, "si": 1}, {"t": "made", "s": 5541, "e": 5741, "si": 1}, {"t": "up", "s": 5741, "e": 5821, "si": 1}, {"t": "my", "s": 5881, "e": 6001, "si": 1}, {"t": "mind", "s": 6061, "e": 6401, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 6621, "e": 6821, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 6881, "e": 6941, "si": 1}, {"t": "make", "s": 6981, "e": 7181, "si": 1}, {"t": "another", "s": 7201, "e": 7481, "si": 1}, {"t": "painful", "s": 7581, "e": 8021, "si": 1}, {"t": "visit", "s": 8061, "e": 8361, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 8422, "e": 8502, "si": 1}, {"t": "you.", "s": 8582, "e": 8702, "si": 1}, {"t": "For", "s": 9202, "e": 9322, "si": 2}, {"t": "if", "s": 9382, "e": 9482, "si": 2}, {"t": "I", "s": 9622, "e": 9642, "si": 2}, {